  "name": "Example: Evaluating an Exponential Expression",
  "problem": "Evaluate $3^4.$",
  "worked_solution": "The expression $3^4$ means $3$ multiplied by itself $4$ times. So we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{3}^{4} & =(3\\times 3)\\times (3\\times 3) \\\\  & =9\\times 9 \\\\  & =81.\\end{aligned}\n$$",
